    "title": "CFD firefighter hospitalized after battling residential fire in Austin - NewsBreak",
    "text": "CHICAGO ( WGN ) – A Chicago firefighter was injured while fighting a residential fire Wednesday night in Austin. The Chicago Fire Department said the fire happened at a home in the 1100 block of North Waller Avenue. Officials said the firefighter was taken to the hospital with non-life threatening injuries. CFD said the fire is under control. No other information was released. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WGN-TV.",
